  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Living Lab India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The vision is to have sustainable and liveable smart cities integrating global sustainable solutions. The expected results are to contribute toward sustainable and livable smart cities integrating global sustainable solutions and contribute towards the implementation of the Government of India&#x2019;s Smart City Programme covering 100 Smart Cities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;-Contribution towards sustainable and liveable smart cities in India integrating global sustainable solutions,
-Contribution towards the implementation of Government of India&#x2019;s (GOI) Smart City Programme covering 100 Smart Cities.

-The results will be measured with the framework of the UN SDG 11 on making cities and human settlements inclusive, safe, resilient and sustainable by 2030. This includes focus on cities adopting and implementing policies and plans towards mitigation and adaptation of climate change.
&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
